# Validated-clock encoder and v1 coordinator readiness sentinel.
#
# Present once the accepted-work-validated sgminer clock table and bridge-global
# coordinator are deployed:
#   public 400 MHz candidate -> factory startup clock index 30.
#   no other public MHz labels are enabled until hardware validation.
#   global mode sends one SET_OPTION request with dest=1, then reads all three
#   board echoes before marking the generation command-verified.
#
# Its presence is what unlocks the "Enable adjustable clocks — flash custom
# firmware (v1)" action in Dev Tools. BOTH the PHP action
# (firmware_flash_custom) and the root wrapper (bkb-firmware.sh flash-custom)
# gate on this file, so the v1 flash is hard-blocked until its matching
# coordinator ships alongside it. Removing this file re-blocks the enable-flash.
